WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.651
First tidy what was typed, then cut it into words.

2
00:00:04.428 --> 00:00:09.153
strip takes off spaces at the ends, and lower makes every letter small.

3
00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:12.754
split cuts the text into a list of words.

4
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.980
words, place zero, is the first word, however it was typed.
